OL,3,GNEWSATrailer of 40 tonnes of waste
OL,4,Aabandoned on road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trailer carrying 40 tonnes of
OL,7,Fconstruction and household waste has
OL,8,Fbeen dumped by a main road in
OL,9,FShropshire.
OL,11,FTelford and Wrekin Council said the
OL,12,FEnvironment Agency was investigating
OL,13,Fand following several lines of enquiry
OL,14,Frelating to the trailer, which was left
OL,15,Fon the A41 Chester Road at Chetwynd
OL,16,FFirs near Newport.
OL,18,FThe authority added that the company
OL,19,Fwhose name appears on the side of the
OL,20,Fvehicle, Grocontinental, was not
OL,21,Fconnected to the incident, having sold
OL,22,Fthe trailer a number of years ago.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
